## 5. Company Discovery

Maintain a company registry instead of hard-coding scrapers for every company.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    SEED[Company Seeds] --> REG[Company Registry]
    REG --> DISC[Career Page Discovery]
    DISC --> URLS[Candidate Career URLs]
    URLS --> FETCH[Fetch Career Page]
    FETCH --> DETECT[Detect ATS / Custom Site]
    DETECT --> META[Store Source Metadata]
