```

Example company record:

```json
{
  "name": "Example Company",
  "domain": "example.com",
  "careerUrl": "https://example.com/careers",
  "ats": "ashby",
  "active": true,
  "priority": "high",
  "lastCrawledAt": "..."
}
```

## 6. Job Ingestion Pipeline

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant Q as Queue
    participant C as Connector
    participant N as Normalizer
    participant D as Deduplicator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    S->>Q: Create ingestion job
    Q->>C: Execute connector
    C->>C: Fetch jobs
    C->>N: Raw job
    N->>N: Normalize fields
    N->>D: Canonical job
    D->>D: Generate fingerprint
    D->>DB: Insert / update job
    DB-->>D: Stored state
```

