```

## 8. Deduplication

A single job may appear on multiple platforms.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    J1[LinkedIn Job] --> FP[Fingerprint / Similarity]
    J2[Naukri Job] --> FP
    J3[Indeed Job] --> FP
    J4[Adzuna Job] --> FP
    J5[Company Career Job] --> FP

    FP --> SAME{Same Job?}

    SAME -->|Yes| MERGE[Merge Sources]
    SAME -->|No| NEW[Create Job]

    MERGE --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    NEW --> DB
```

Use a deterministic fingerprint based on normalized company, title, location, and description. Add fuzzy or semantic similarity for near-duplicates.

