## 23. Failure Handling

A single source failure must not stop the complete pipeline.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    JOB[Ingestion Job] --> TRY[Connector Execution]
    TRY --> OK{Success?}

    OK -->|Yes| NORMALIZE[Normalize]
    OK -->|No| RETRY[Retry with Backoff]

    RETRY --> LIMIT{Retry Limit?}
    LIMIT -->|No| TRY
    LIMIT -->|Yes| DLQ[Dead Letter Queue]

    DLQ --> ALERT[Log / Alert]
```

