## 30. Summary

The platform should be designed as a source-agnostic job ingestion and application system.

The core abstraction is:

```text
Many Sources
    ↓
Connectors
    ↓
Canonical Job
    ↓
Deduplication
    ↓
Candidate Matching
    ↓
Resume Version
    ↓
Application Preparation
    ↓
Human Approval
    ↓
Permitted Browser Automation
    ↓
Application Tracking
```

This architecture supports adding new job portals, ATS providers, and company career pages without redesigning the rest of the system.
